{title: 677 - Heavenly Father, to Thee We Pray}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: Eb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Sentences and Responses}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[Eb]Heavenly [Gm]Father, to [Cm]Thee [Bb]we [Eb]pray,
[Eb]On the [Gm]holy Sabbath [Bb]day;
[Bb7]Through Thy Word Thy [Ab/Eb]will [Eb]make [Bb]known;
[Gm]May [Eb]each [Bb/D]heart [Bb7/D]become [Eb]Thy throne,
[Eb]Let Thy [Gm/D]living [Cm]water flow
[Bb7]That we [Eb]Thy boundless [Cm]love [Eb/Bb]may know.
[Bb7]Amen.
